# Deployed Webapp Testing Playbook

Use this process for validating `https://fbuploadprov2.vercel.app/`.

## Scope Defaults

- Skip dedicated auth feature testing (signup/otp/forgot-password/update-password).
- Login is allowed as a prerequisite for agency and super-admin test execution.
- Skip usage CSV export tests unless explicitly requested by the human.
- Skip Facebook connect and magic-link connect flows by default.
- Keep Facebook account delete flow in test scope.

## Credential Handling

- Store testing credentials/secrets only in local `webapp/.env.local`.
- Never store passwords or app secrets in repository files, rules, plans, commits, or logs.
- Read credentials at runtime from local environment.
- If any required credential is missing, ask the human before continuing.

