## Facebook Account Precondition

- Expect at least one existing connected Facebook account in agency dashboard.
- If no Facebook account is connected, stop and ask the human to connect one before continuing.

## DB Verification Requirement

- For each write interaction, verify expected DB deltas in production.
- Validate affected tables (for example `users`, `facebook_accounts`, `pages`, `system_settings`, `token_transactions`).
- Report pass/fail with expected vs actual DB evidence after each interaction.
